Package: EHRSim
Type: Package
Title: Simulate Synthetic EHR Data
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Haroon", "Abbas", email = "lsh2504466@alumni.lshtm.ac.uk", role = c("aut")),
    person("Elizabeth", "Williamson", email = "Elizabeth.Williamson@lshtm.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cph", "cre"))
    )
Description: Provides wrapper functions for simulating synthetic electronic
    health data for one or multiple GP practices using a bundled
    pipeline. It also constructs treatment-effect truth under persistent,
    fixed-course, and episodic treatment strategies.
